In src/app.html growthItems, use the table's rule. After `const gB = P.grownBody(...)`, add:
  const r2 = (x, x0) => (rough && x / x0 >= 1.1 ? Number(x.toPrecision(2)) : x);
  const ab = (x, x0) => (rough && x / x0 >= 1.1 ? 'about ' : '');
Then replace the height and density pieces of the first item with:
  ', so he is ' + ab(gB.H, body.H) + fmtDist(r2(gB.H, body.H)) + ' tall at ' + ab(gB.rho, body.rho) + fmtDensity2(r2(gB.rho, body.rho)) + ' (' + growFormText(gB.s) + ').'
